<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαινάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαίνομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>raving, frantic</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύσσα</span>
			v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				941.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάκχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					915
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as
			Subst., <i>mad woman</i>, esp. <i>Bacchante,
			Maenad</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαινάδι ἴση</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.460
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				386
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				382
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				212
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; of the Furies, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				500
			</span></i> (lyr.); of Cassandra, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				173
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόρνη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.203
			</span></i> cod. A, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				<u>Epim.</u>
				83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>causing madness</i>, esp. of love, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαινὰς ὄρνις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.216
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
